    "text": "A fair coin is tossed once. If it shows head, then <math><mn>2</mn></math> fair dice are thrown simultaneously otherwise <math><mn>3</mn></math> fair dice are thrown simultaneously. The probability that all the dice show different numbers is <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi></math>, then <math><mn>180</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi></math> is equal to"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "125",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>→</mo></math>a fair coin shows head&nbsp;<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mo>→</mo></math>a fair coin shows tail&nbsp;<br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>→</mo><mn>2</mn></math> fair dice show unequal numbers<br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>→</mo><mn>3</mn></math> fair dice show unequal numbers<br />Probability if all dice shows unequal number<br /><math><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>12</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>15</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>36</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>25</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>36</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>"
